{"id":"8a33bc6ffc28ef59","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_STInterp.md","title":"STInterp","display":"STInterp","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"STInterp","parameters":["B","eta","tau"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"STInterp"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>B</span><span>eta</span><span>tau</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：简单类型集合语义。有序参数：<code>B</code>、<code>eta</code>、<code>tau</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ STInterp B eta tau)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists T\n  (and\n    (@ STTySet B T)\n    (and\n      (@ FunDom eta B)\n      (and\n        (@ FunDom tau T)\n        (and\n          (forall b\n            (implies (in b B) (exists a (exists x (and (@ TBase b a) (and (@ App eta b x) (@ App tau a x)))))))\n          (forall a\n            (forall b\n              (forall c\n                (implies\n                  (and (in a T) (and (in b T) (@ TArr a b c)))\n                  (exists x\n                    (exists y (exists z (and (@ App tau a x) (and (@ App tau b y) (and (@ Space x y z) (@ App tau c z))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2fa14e4bd3447c97\" href=\"?note=2fa14e4bd3447c97\" title=\"ZFC_FunDom\">FunDom</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4bf42e2244363b93\" href=\"?note=4bf42e2244363b93\" title=\"ZFC_STTySet\">STTySet</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0d262c1cdcf87048\" href=\"?note=0d262c1cdcf87048\" title=\"ZFC_Space\">Space</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2f67326629fff1ce\" href=\"?note=2f67326629fff1ce\" title=\"ZFC_TArr\">TArr</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b30f1eee99e1c728\" href=\"?note=b30f1eee99e1c728\" title=\"ZFC_TBase\">TBase</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ STInterp B eta tau)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FunDom|FunDom]]；[[ZFC_STTySet|STTySet]]；[[ZFC_Space|Space]]；[[ZFC_TArr|TArr]]；[[ZFC_TBase|TBase]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FunDom","status":"resolved","id":"2fa14e4bd3447c97","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FunDom|FunDom]]；[[ZFC_STTySet|STTySet]]；[[ZFC_Space|Space]]；[[ZFC_TArr|TArr]]；[[ZFC_TBase|TBase]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_STTySet","status":"resolved","id":"4bf42e2244363b93","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FunDom|FunDom]]；[[ZFC_STTySet|STTySet]]；[[ZFC_Space|Space]]；[[ZFC_TArr|TArr]]；[[ZFC_TBase|TBase]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Space","status":"resolved","i